          "at": "No, it's not working."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b33",
      "narration": "At 1:29 and 9 seconds, the Dali's starboard bow struck Pier 17 at 6.4 knots, with more than four times the sideways force the pier could resist.",
