        {
          "kind": "footage",
          "assets": [
            "mir-fig53-wire1-wire3-in-block"
          ],
          "label": "Terminal Block 381 · NTSB",
          "at": "Wire 1, in Terminal Block 381."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b42",
      "narration": "Homendy compared it to hunting for a loose rivet on the Eiffel Tower.",
      "visual": {
        "kind": "footage",
        "assets": [
          "broll-yard-gusset-rivets"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b43",
      "narration": "In the lab, investigators X-rayed the block. Under the microscope, they found arcing damage on the wire's metal tip, called a ferrule, and on the clamp it sat in.",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "kind": "footage",
          "assets": [
            "mir-fig56-terminal-block-xray"
          ],
          "label": "X-ray, Terminal Block 381 · NTSB"
        },
        {
          "kind": "footage",
          "assets": [
