        "note": "NTSB MIR-25-40, Finding 12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b52",
      "narration": "The NTSB's probable cause: a loss of electrical power, due to a loose signal wire connection stemming from the improper installation of wire-label banding.",
      "visual": {
        "kind": "document",
        "source": "NTSB MIR-25-40, Probable Cause, p. 202",
        "quote": "a loss of electrical power (blackout), due to a loose signal wire connection to a terminal block stemming from the improper installation of wire-label banding",
        "highlight": "improper installation of wire-label banding"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b53",
      "narration": "That explains why the ship hit the bridge. It does not explain why the bridge fell, or why six men died.",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "kind": "footage",
          "assets": [
