          ],
          "note": "Blue Nagoya displaced about one-tenth of the Dali · NTSB"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b56",
      "narration": "In 2006, at a harbor safety meeting, an MDTA representative stated that the Key Bridge was not designed to withstand contact by a large vessel.",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "kind": "stamp",
          "text": "2006",
          "assets": [
            "broll-cg-boat-harbor-skyline2"
          ],
          "subtext": "Harbor safety meeting"
        },
        {
          "kind": "document",
          "source": "NTSB MIR-25-40, p. 134",
          "quote": "the MDTA representative stated that the Key Bridge was not designed to withstand contact by a large vessel.",
          "highlight": "not designed to withstand contact by a large vessel",
          "at": "an MDTA representative stated"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b57",
      "narration": "The MDTA never ran the recommended vulnerability assessment; no rule required it. The NTSB ran it afterward: a collapse risk almost 30 times the threshold for a critical bridge.",
      "visuals": [
        {
          "kind": "footage",
          "assets": [
            "broll-yard-twisted-steel"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "chart",
