          "subtext": "Expected opening",
          "at": "in late 2030,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b70",
      "narration": "At 1:25 that morning, a breaker opened because one wire had let go. It had waited nine years. The bridge had waited longer. As Homendy put it, like all of the accidents we investigate, this was preventable.",
